249
00:17:09,696 --> 00:17:10,864
Sí.

250
00:17:16,995 --> 00:17:18,663
Ahí.

251
00:17:49,277 --> 00:17:50,487
Mierda.

252
00:17:57,619 --> 00:17:59,454
Mierda.

253
00:18:06,878 --> 00:18:08,672
