284
00:19:45,685 --> 00:19:47,103
Nos vemos allá.

285
00:20:00,158 --> 00:20:01,951
Los interrumpo un momento.

286
00:20:02,118 --> 00:20:03,536
- Disculpa.
- Es todo tuyo.

287
00:20:20,762 --> 00:20:21,846
Hola a todos.

288
00:20:22,806 --> 00:20:26,017
Antes de beber de más,

289
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:30,897
